## Context
Audit B2 (`docs/2026-09-24-rules-coherence-audit.md`). `scripts/on-start.sh` tells every project to enter a
worktree first. livre `AGENTS.md` says "Travail direct sur main" and sets
`worktree.bgIsolation: none`; harness `git.md` § Prose workpackages exempts
manuscript prose in paper repos, but the hook text does not.

## Decision needed
Recommended: the hook stays silent when the project declares the opt-out
(`bgIsolation: none` or a one-line marker), and says so in one declarative
line. Alternative: keep the instruction and let AGENTS.md override it.

## Exit criteria
- [ ] Author decision logged here
- [ ] A livre session start no longer contradicts livre's AGENTS.md
